      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the \"Order is complete and all items were returned,\" then we proceed with the process. However, if the \"Order is incomplete and items are missing,\" we still continue the process. Similarly, if the \"Order is complete but items are damaged,\""
      ],
      "justification": "Captures the XOR decision point and the condition for complete orders."
    },
